%"><div><span><br/></span></div></div><ix:continuation id="f-320-2"><ix:continuation id="f-333-1" continuedAt="f-333-2"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">(a): The Company subleases a portion of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="sublease" contextRef="c-5" decimals="INF" name="dlhc:LesseeOperatingSubleaseNumber" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" scale="0" id="f-344">one</ix:nonFraction> of its leased facilities. The sublease is classified as an operating lease with respect to the underlying asset. The sublease term is <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="dlhc:LesseeOperatingSubleaseLeaseTerm" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="f-345">5</ix:nonNumeric> years and includes <ix:nonFraction unitRef="sublease_option" contextRef="c-1" decimals="INF" name="dlhc:LesseeOperatingSubleaseNumberOfOptionsToExtend" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" scale="0" id="f-346">two</ix:nonFraction> additional <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="dlhc:LesseeOperatingSubleaseOptionExtensionPeriod" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="f-347">1</ix:nonNumeric>-year term extension options.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="padding-left:36pt"><span><br/></span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock" id="f-348" escape="true"><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company's future minimum lease payments as of September&#160;30, 2025 are as follows (in thousands):</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:80.332%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:17.468%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;verti